 1951 to 2025, and August to September came in under 90% of normal in 38 of those 75 years, more than any other pair. In 2025 on the middle of the grids, June to July came in at 66% of normal and January to February at 62%. So far in 2026, March to April came in at 222% of normal and June to July at 72%. Grid 27775 had its driest year in 1971 at 70% of normal.</p>"}
